From f2c0f2be0dabbac98b511a4a26670a0b93f3d0af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:11:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mod entity menus declared in JSON (FORK-10 5b): tabs,
 buttons, menu data and text, virtual slots

An entity kind's `menu` names a menu type of its mod: open-entity-menu opens it over a
mod placeholder, drawn by its screen as a block's. Slots past the container's are
virtual while it is open and come back to the player on close; result takes call the
new export entity-menu-taken, buttons the new export entity-menu-button, and
mod-entity-update carries menu-data and menu-text. open-entity-menu moves to API 46.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
